{"version":1,"content":"<p>如今我們身邊的無線信號，無論是 Wi-Fi 還是 5G，遇到足夠厚的牆壁或金屬箱都可能被阻斷。但重力不同，目前已知沒有任何材料能夠屏蔽或阻擋重力。澳大利亞的物理學家正是利用這一特性，讓一條簡短訊息穿過了一堵磚牆。令人意外的是，發射裝置竟然是他們所在大樓裏的一部老電梯。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1588240.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:24:43.126155+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T16:14:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:34.758951+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:34.758951+00:00","content_hash":"01eb4e6baa8ed73c226caaf2087b1a08f19981c08f11fe49ea4806c431d5721a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}